<title>USA: Global Village CFO Walker resigns.</title>
<headline>Global Village CFO Walker resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Village Communication Inc said James Walker resigned as chief financial officer to take &quot;a similar position&quot; with another company.</p>
<p>The company said it has started a search for a qualified replacement.</p>
